      "source": "plan-meta/description",
      "content": "Embed a ~50-line inline JavaScript BM25 scorer in the build mode HTML layout. The scorer implements the standard BM25 formula per SPEC-013 §4.9:\n\n  score(q, d) = Σ IDF(t) * (tf(t,d) * (k1 + 1)) / (tf(t,d) + k1 * (1 - b + b * dl/avgDl))\n\n  where k1 = 1.2, b = 0.75\n  IDF(t) = ln((N - df(t) + 0.5) / (df(t) + 0.5) + 1)\n\nThe JS module should:\n  1. Expose a search(query, index) function.\n  2. Tokenize the query (lowercase, split on whitespace/punctuation — same as Tantivy's default).\n  3. For each document, compute BM25 score against query terms.\n  4. Return results sorted by descending score, filtered to score > 0.\n\nThe scorer is embedded via include_str!() of a .js file or inline in the HTML template. Store the JS in src/web/assets/bm25.js or similar.\n\nADR-013-004.",
